---@class posthog.hog_flows.WorkflowProposalOutcome
---@field versions posthog.hog_flows.WorkflowProposalOutcomeVersionsList Every published version around the change, each read over its own time live, so a later edit shows up as its own point rather than ending the comparison.
---@field before posthog.hog_flows.WorkflowProposalVersionOutcome|distilled.Null The version the change was proposed against.
---@field after posthog.hog_flows.WorkflowProposalVersionOutcome|distilled.Null The versions that carried the change. Null until the proposal is applied.
---@field change_ended_at_version number|distilled.Null The version that changed what the suggestion changed, which is where the after side stops. Null while the change is still live.
---@field unavailable_guardrails posthog.hog_flows.WorkflowProposalOutcomeUnavailableGuardrailsList Counter-metrics that cannot be read yet, named so their absence is not read as zero.

